  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyPolicyIntro": "Touba respects your privacy. This policy explains the types of data we collect, and how we use and protect it when you use the app. By using Touba, you agree to this policy.",
  "ppSec1Title": "1. Data We Collect",
  "ppSec1Body": "When you create an account, we collect: name, email, phone number, and profile picture (optional). When linked to a player or team, your football data (position, number, team) and stats (goals, assists, cards) generated by the system from match results may be saved. We also automatically collect usage data, analytics, and crash reports via Google Firebase to improve app performance.",
  "ppSec2Title": "2. How We Use Your Data",
  "ppSec2Body": "We use your data to operate your account, manage teams, tournaments, and matches, display your card and stats, communicate with you when needed, send activity-related notifications (like accepting a join request or match result), and improve and protect the service from abuse.",
  "ppSec3Title": "3. Data Sharing",
  "ppSec3Body": "We do not sell your personal data to any party. Some data is processed by service providers (Google Firebase for hosting, authentication, and analytics). Some information is naturally public within the app (team name, player name, stats, standings). The team manager's phone number is not publicly displayed.",
  "ppSec4Title": "4. Your Rights and Data Control",
  "ppSec4Body": "You can edit your profile data at any time from the 'Edit Profile' screen. You can also permanently delete your account from account settings; upon deletion, your personal data associated with the account is removed as permitted by law.",
  "ppSec5Title": "5. Data Security and Retention",
  "ppSec5Body": "We take technical measures to protect your data (server security rules, verifying request integrity via App Check). We retain your data as long as your account is active or as necessary to provide the service and comply with regulations.",
  "ppSec6Title": "6. Children",
  "ppSec6Body": "The app is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their data. If found otherwise, we delete the data immediately upon learning of it.",
  "ppSec7Title": "7. Changes to This Policy",
  "ppSec7Body": "We may update this policy from time to time, and we will post the updated version within the app, updating the 'Last updated' date above.",
  "ppSec8Title": "8. Contact",
  "ppSec8Body": "For any privacy inquiries, contact us at: senanxsh@gmail.com",

  "termsConditionsTitle": "Terms and Conditions",
  "termsIntro": "Welcome to Touba. By using the app, you agree to these terms and conditions. Please read them carefully.",
  "tcSec1Title": "1. Nature of the Service",
  "tcSec1Body": "Touba is a platform for organizing amateur and grassroots football: creating teams, managing players, organizing tournaments and matches, and displaying standings and stats.",
  "tcSec2Title": "2. Account and Your Responsibility",
  "tcSec2Body": "You are responsible for the accuracy of your data and for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and everything that happens under it. The data you enter must be true and not impersonate others.",
  "tcSec3Title": "3. Roles and Permissions",
  "tcSec3Body": "The captain manages their team and players. Permissions to organize tournaments and confirm results are granted by platform management. Confirming a match result is exclusively the organizer's responsibility, and stats are calculated automatically by the system and may not be tampered with.",
  "tcSec4Title": "4. Acceptable Use",
  "tcSec4Body": "Using the app for any illegal activity, posting offensive content or inappropriate images, impersonating others, or attempting to tamper with team, tournament, or stat data is prohibited. We reserve the right to remove violating content and suspend violating accounts.",
  "tcSec5Title": "5. Content You Upload",
  "tcSec5Body": "You retain ownership of the content you upload (like photos), and you grant the platform a license to display it within the app for the purpose of operating the service. You are responsible for owning the rights to what you upload.",
  "tcSec6Title": "6. Reports",
  "tcSec6Body": "You can report any violating content or behavior via the reporting tools in the app, and management will review it and take appropriate action.",
  "tcSec7Title": "7. Disclaimer",
  "tcSec7Body": "The service is provided 'as is'. We strive to ensure data accuracy but do not guarantee it is error-free, nor do we bear responsibility for any disputes arising between teams or players outside the platform.",
  "tcSec8Title": "8. Termination of Service",
  "tcSec8Body": "You have the right to delete your account at any time. Management has the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms.",
  "tcSec9Title": "9. Applicable Law and Contact",
  "tcSec9Body": "These terms are subject to the laws of the Republic of Iraq. For any inquiries: senanxsh@gmail.com",

